    "ix, 194 pages : 23 cm",
    "The Gang is known beyond Morgan, Minnesota. This self-made support group of guys, with their close-bonded friendships, daily routines, and active physical and mental lifestyles have the edge in successful aging. Eighty-two-year old Russ, the driver, has his loyalty tested when his best friend Rich's failing health demands his attention and then when he is wooed by Agnes and her home cooking",
